### SEARCH BUG - BOOKS
POST http://localhost:5172/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "50% Off Sale",
  "author": "Some Author",
  "year": 2020
}

POST http://localhost:5172/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "_Riyad Off Sale",
  "author": "Some Author",
  "year": 2020
}

### 2. Search for (% _)... should return ONLY the book above, not all books
### Search for the literal ((%)) character.
### '%' must be URL-encoded as '%25'. (For example, '%50' is decoded to 'P', not '%'.)
GET http://localhost:5172/books?search=%25&page=1&pageSize=5
GET http://localhost:5172/books?search=_&page=1&pageSize=5


### SEARCH BUG - MEMBERS

### 3. Add a member with a literal % in the name
POST http://localhost:5172/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "100% Riyad",
    "email": "riyad100@example.com"
}
POST http://localhost:5172/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "_ Riyad",
    "email": "riyad100@example.com"
}

### 4. Search for (% _)... should return ONLY the member above, not all members
GET http://localhost:5172/members?search=%25&page=1&pageSize=5
GET http://localhost:5172/members?search=_&page=1&pageSize=5

